+        <t indent="0" pn="section-6.1-12">The model of usage is that there is one Alex server running at
+each institution (though this is not required in any way).  Users
+mount the local server which caches files for users at that site.</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-6.1-13">Any information put into any anonymous FTP site becomes available
+via Alex.</t>
