+        <t indent="0" pn="section-6.7-54">Server software runs on most flavors of unix, requires dbm
+and perl, and requires about 1.4 GB of data on disk, with
+considerable /tmp space available.</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-6.7-55">Server software is available to any site which wants to run
+a server.  Server sites are encouraged to offer the service
+to the net at large.</t>
+        <dl newline="false" spacing="compact" indent="3" pn="section-6.7-56">
