+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.9-34">Bibliography:</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.9-35">Other Information:</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.9-36">This Working Group was formed jointly in the User Services and
+Applications Areas of the Internet Engineering Task Force.</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.9-37">The RARE (Reseaux Associes pour la Recherche Europeenne) ISUS WG
+(Information Services and User Support Working Group) is
+represented by NIR-WG co-chair Jill Foster.  NIR-WG information
