+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.18-3">Name of group: USMARC Advisory Group; OCLC Internet Resources
+Cataloging Experiment</t>
+        <t indent="0" pn="section-7.18-4">Sponsoring Organisations: OCLC, Library of Congress,
+USMARC Advisory Group</t>
+        <dl newline="false" spacing="compact" indent="3" pn="section-7.18-5">
