+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-2">Purpose and scope:</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-3">This template is to be used to collect the information necessary to
+identify and track the development of networked information retrieval
+tools.  It is intended that the main part of this will be completed by
+the main individual responsible for the tool.  Sections of the
+template may require completion by others.</t>
